[00:08.610]﻿Caught in the middle of a crossfire
{"被困在交火的中心"}
[00:12.100]Lost my balance on a high wire
{"在钢丝上失去平衡"}
[00:16.280]Trying to figure out what to do
{"试图想出该怎么做"}
[00:24.230]Pushed to the edge of my reason
{"被逼到理智的边缘"}
[00:28.210]Everywhere around me it's treason
{"周围尽是背叛"}
[00:32.270]I don't want to do that to you
{"我不想那样对你"}
[00:39.580]Kamikaze airplanes in the sky
{"神风战机划过天际"}
[00:43.320]Are we going down or will we fly?
{"我们会坠落还是翱翔？"}
[00:47.330]This could be a shipwreck on the shore
{"这可能成为岸边的沉船"}
[00:51.220]Or we could sail away forevermore
{"抑或我们能永远远航"}
[00:57.410]This time it's sink or swim, sink or swim
{"这次不成功便成仁"}
[01:08.340]Hearing the song in your laughter
{"从你的笑声听见旋律"}
[01:12.250]A melody I chase after
{"那是我追逐的乐章"}
[01:16.350]No one else has done this to me
{"从未有人让我如此"}
