[01:41.580]This time it's sink or swim
{"这次不成功便成仁"}
[01:48.880]Take a deep breath
{"深呼吸"}
[01:52.310]No more time left
{"时间所剩无几"}
[01:56.150]This is what I thought I wanted
{"这曾是我所求"}
[02:00.160]Why am I afraid?
{"为何我却畏惧？"}
